{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34223","headline":"奉和袭美添渔具五篇 篛笠 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美添渔具五篇 篛笠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝携下枫浦，晚戴出烟艇。\n冒雪或平檐，听泉时仄顶。\n飙移霭然色，波乱危如影。\n不识九衢尘，终年居下泂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34223.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34223","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}